        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, federal prosecutors have significant discretion and there can be no assurance that the federal prosecutor for any district in which we operate will not choose to strictly enforce the federal laws governing cannabis.",
